*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
REPORT ZTEST_EXCEPTIONS.

DATA : LO_ANALYTICS TYPE REF TO ZCL_SO_ANALYTICS,
      IT_EXCEPTIONS TYPE ZSO_EXCEPTION_TT.

CREATE OBJECT LO_ANALYTICS.

LO_ANALYTICS->BUILD_EXCEPTIONS(
EXPORTING
  IP_THRESHOLD = '100000'
  IP_DAYS = 30
  IMPORTING
    ET_EXCEPTIONS = IT_EXCEPTIONS ).

CL_DEMO_OUTPUT=>DISPLAY( IT_EXCEPTIONS ).
